doff: printed page 70"}, {"id": "f0700200-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "structuralNodeId": "b0700100-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "sequenceIndex": 2, "blockType": "heading", "languageCode": "en", "direction": "ltr", "textContent": "Quotation—VII", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": false, "verificationStatus": "in_review", "provenanceNotes": "Locked human-reviewed handoff: printed page 70"}, {"id": "f0700300-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "structuralNodeId": "b0700100-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "sequenceIndex": 3, "blockType": "arabic", "languageCode": "ar", "direction": "rtl", "textContent": "وَإِنَّهَا لَكَبِيرَةٌ إِلَّا عَلَى الْخَاشِعِينَ ۝ الَّذِينَ يَظُنُّونَ أَنَّهُمْ مُلَاقُو رَبِّهِمْ وَأَنَّهُمْ إِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُونَ", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": true, "verificationStatus": "in_review", "provenanceNotes": "Locked human-reviewed handoff: printed page 70"}, {"id": "f0700400-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "structuralNodeId": "b0700100-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "sequenceIndex": 4, "blockType": "translation", "languageCode": "en", "direction": "ltr", "textContent": "\"And truly it (salaat) is hard save for the humble-minded; who know that they have to meet their Lord, and that unto Him they are returning.\" (II: 45–46)", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": true, "verificationStatus": "in_review", "provenanceNotes": "Locked human-reviewed handoff: printed page 70"}, {"id": "f0700500-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "structuralNodeId": "b0700200-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "sequenceIndex": 5, "blockType": "heading", "languageCode": "en", "direction": "ltr", "textContent": "Quotation—VIII", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": false, "verificationStatus": "in_review", "provenanceNotes": "Locked human-reviewed handoff: printed page 70"}, {"id": "f0700600-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "structuralNodeId": "b0700200-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "sequenceIndex": 6, "blockType": "arabic", "languageCode": "ar", "direction": "rtl", "textContent": "فِي بُيُوتٍ أَذِنَ اللَّهُ أَنْ تُرْفَعَ وَيُذْكَرَ فِيهَا اسْمُهُ يُسَبِّحُ لَهُ فِيهَا بِالْغُدُوِّ وَالْآصَالِ ۝ رِجَالٌ لَا تُلْهِيهِمْ تِجَارَةٌ وَلَا بَيْعٌ عَنْ ذِكْرِ اللَّهِ وَإِقَامِ الصَّلَاةِ وَإِيتَاءِ الزَّكَاةِ يَخَافُونَ يَوْمًا تَتَقَلَّبُ فِيهِ الْقُلُوبُ وَالْأَبْصَارُ ۝ لِيَجْزِيَهُمُ اللَّهُ أَحْسَنَ مَا عَمِلُوا وَيَزِيدَهُمْ مِنْ فَضْلِهِ وَاللَّهُ يَرْزُقُ مَنْ يَشَاءُ بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": true, "verificationStatus": "in_review", "provenanceNotes": "Locked human-reviewed handoff: printed page 70"}, {"id": "f0700700-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "structuralNodeId": "b0700200-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "sequenceIndex": 7, "blockType": "translation", "languageCode": "en", "direction": "ltr", "textContent": "\"In houses which Allah hath allowed to be exalted, and His name shall be remembered therein, do offer praise to Him at morning and evening, men whom neither merchandise nor sale beguileth from remembrance of Allah and establishment of salaat and paying Zakaat, who fear that Day when the hearts and the eyeballs will be over-turned so that Allah may reward them for the best of what they did and increase reward for them out of His bounty. Allah giveth blessings without measure to whom He will.\" (XXIV: 36 to 38)", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": true, "verificationStatus": "in_review", "provenanceNotes": "Locked human-reviewed handoff: printed page 70"}, {"id": "f0700800-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "structuralNodeId": "b0700200-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "sequenceIndex": 8, "blockType": "english", "languageCode": "en", "direction": "ltr", "textContent": "Hadhrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Radhiyallaho anho) says, \"Establishment of salaat means performance of ruku and sajdah, properly and constant concentration in salaat with complete humility and submission.\" Hadhrat Qataadah (Radhiyallaho anho) says: \"Wherever the words ''Establishment of salaat'' occur in Qur''an, they mean to guard its hours, to perform wudhu in the right manner and to observe ruku and sajdah properly.\"", "rawOcrText": null, "ttsEligible": true, "verificationStatus": "in_review", "provenanceNotes": "Locked human-reviewed handoff: printed page 70"}]}'::jsonb);